OL,3,GNEWSA'Historic' first as two osprey
OL,4,Achicks born on Anglesey
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo osprey chicks have been born on
OL,7,FAnglesey for the first time, according
OL,8,Fto conservationists.
OL,10,FThe baby birds were hatched earlier
OL,11,Fthis summer, and have since
OL,12,Fsuccessfully left the nest, with hopes
OL,13,Fthey may return.
OL,15,FFriends of the Ospreys, the
OL,16,Fconservation group who monitor the
OL,17,Fprivate site, said they were "over the
OL,18,Fmoon" at the news, and hoped it pointed
OL,19,Fto a bright future for the species on
OL,20,Fthe island.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
